      "hash": "fb51ce6ca8fcc6e0472f4e2dbf4bad2b94422bb0452ddf6ee279e6abbf4e1a49"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f520fc38ca747c89baa6b8902abb4c66f8caccbfb25114bd66cbef65cfc5eb5",
      "text": "Calling Our Server",
      "hash": "45eefca6880dcad3ae10d28187ddadb0b1cd98599d496bc5821da043808029c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef835b4205015ab39b939b45546161059661f4eca90ca6f18010e320a79577b9",
      "text": "Conclusion",
      "hash": "89db2ad881f29c18b305a20c8ed7bdffdfde49d633c27a83bd204bf9cfedaba3"
    },
    {
      "id": "2a657a4543563bd01b5c3c7890a503e807e95b8fde3f04a4e60fedb06f37037a",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c228442b9ef9df77a16d1c9b3f7b1ebbc0af90407d698f74e735a0408662b56",
      "text": "It's pretty common if you're building any kind of chat bot to want to keep track of the conversation history.",
      "hash": "3e3fb7a7c7fcad8641930d9d0e8074a5c35ab69af2c5bb9bfddb6a61ad5c122d"
    },
    {
      "id": "c009d73088f8d70b3013586f84f76e4ee4b2d0fa7d70b1413b1def544c60a89c",
      "text": "This is so the LLM has context over the conversation you've already had.",
      "hash": "01a7e5ae8b71d1c8fde95ddee28391d1b5df718b893bb5a34a66ab78dba2fb24"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae8bd48af9bfecd649d4e4ba9353bc0c005359818640244c8cf01f18715672e6",
      "text": "So you can ask follow-up questions without having to rephrase your question every time.",
      "hash": "562a2bfd6a1f0e3d332aee4d7305058a02fcddbede33c411c7765a1b35f660f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "a39e430504d70f14d3a6a6e89423ff9b71f2570ea284c6e5af4ff459698507d3",
      "text": "Not only that, but understanding how conversations are persisted is really important for communicating with the LLM over the wire.",
      "hash": "2c9d28ade8ecc1ef46c246f53d5d274f253f1f280c212a7b52726da1f8fc30ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "be887392e51cf0777da33d9e29fcc6e60ffeadea076fe51c020aa7e54eee1fcd",
      "text": "We're going to show how to do that with the Vercel AI SDK in this example.",
      "hash": "f6960ff9d6223b101bfa4ffa8257edad7b61f0ed5cad3d9c806bcafd31776964"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9e40cfb024af7464e4dfb0cdaf116cfddb44032fbe981229c5326d7c9109b05",
      "text": "Let's start by understanding the shape of what a conversation history might look like.",
      "hash": "aaf1e576bc6b115bca497c2a628a1b901b1022813eb3ee9fcdd6669ecfec1856"
    },
    {
      "id": "59ec5f8d056fad072cfdc38c3cfc9f9347b84c7c469a0ab184bf3618ca8eb7e4",
      "text": "The AI SDK exposes a type called",
      "hash": "21e317d164b16b888631f9c6f12f4c9fbd87badd36498efafd38be21bb55e743"
    },
    {
      "id": "5ea2db499e9c8255200f07c5c036fd45f549e2acdc32c8e09653e2798786f27d",
      "text": ". This is an object that represents a message in a conversation.",
      "hash": "d8ee31a235e9f9d9a427ebfbc7f18f5e7a13a2607caf70d2956d10e68a5c1989"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b7ca824a2e6c3844131423f831a0fc5454cfa0d1c1ea93d79f8ca6a1c2fb306",
      "text": "If we understand this type we'll understand a conversation history - I promise.",
      "hash": "db19639d9a041791824e94f88210bec6203f9c5e465f38e973b975981e562e15"
    },
    {
      "id": "efa63bcd9d0b97049064e32fe4f685a7a308d694351c10a3b33498186f4a7837",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5b5ec09142165f4e3b17d690486f8c2d691206095dcfc2b9ede6252af7a47e0",
      "text": "Let's try messing about with it to see what it contains. Let's create a messages array, assigning it the type of an array of core messages.",
      "hash": "bef381e2f69a8c4756cd0915e221737bbf10f39b6fa9b3677d9771610bb07d64"
    },
    {
      "id": "c37dd5891b8134ca65f2ebdae4869d00a0d66cd4b53f30ebeb1060bcd543e439",
      "text": "Every message has to contain a role property. This is a string that can be user, system, assistant or tool.",
      "hash": "4633d6827acdbf5472bc2b6767c14ab097f41e36bd9632219b52455f3bd4ac9c"
    },
    {
      "id": "590cf96806bea09b39830a2cff3d1b1350a0ad13acd74d84f19bd05f706f1298",
      "text": "Each message must also contain a",
      "hash": "ebf9bbce73e46503763747c0bb236925d07962bb7112d2fc2e487b181eabb80d"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e085a8024f9c4970550b4a88944a8c931e40155ee001be72de98c2721e7a662",
      "text": "property - this is the content of the message.",
      "hash": "b1431eb10d8fda0ad16d6d88d8b23239cded63ca68fcf2161a2dd2bb63767b8a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8307690323b19dd0817db2bf98f45f42195a2eb92ef3bfde9054685b0f12ea9",
      "text": "In this example, the conversation history contains a single message from the user saying \"Hello, you!\".",
      "hash": "666fe1b1688d5fbd66a17ea9e60e1dc9e3fc8dc3e49d3a69c0aaaa5c401d6f71"
    },
    {
      "id": "397bf0937c12ae4e2a398cc2e19bc7dcd4e213e4ae37c3a7be498455eca03055",
      "text": "To represent the LLM replying, we use the \"assistant\" role:",
      "hash": "1d716febcb5d94f00e8560ba6e24dd1980aa4d0b5ab93500524daf2af7b18b35"
    },
    {
      "id": "721c52290041c737b1904188ce83b02e02e580ce08fc6a88141de0ea81f54ee5",
      "text": "We had a brief look at system prompts earlier. They're represented in the message history with a role of",
      "hash": "5287dcc8831a7b0882f8f60efca20b0cb552ef95f74cc72f72b13c27ee614542"
    },
    {
      "id": "b511a0f6cad98ecb1ca3cb58f1aacd9dd279449f85c10614839f532edce38d22",
      "text": "In this case, we're telling the LLM to greet everyone that speaks to it.",
      "hash": "b680257574493d9c8624ce947ff9842e6e307ac2de0f1f9698607d231b097123"
    },
    {
      "id": "5bd1c03a528d47e71dca8fcc718e7bb82dba9efb0e97cbdc1fc10a1e9c9a8a84",
      "text": "We'll take a look at tools later when we cover tool calling.",
      "hash": "4436600b67784fc877c8c0f4739dc602def15f2411ab57d9b7bd45f9920ccfa8"
    },
    {
      "id": "736b78fd44be20a317ca65789bd7c4cc1fadce5877ce9ecf523cf2103d7acd42",
      "text": "As conversations get longer and longer, this array will grow with more",
      "hash": "fb60bdecc709311eaa5208c9046275dab2be906d19e711ca747128a82e16afae"
    },
    {
      "id": "988bb1e2994d8a4e2aa6fe70951f639eba5ff1c670a491bc91d71571e3b26e36",
      "text": "messages being added.",
      "hash": "2da8707d038c8b25e8aae67100a0495b21cb4d1558b08fdb0aca5b41e357dece"
    },
    {
      "id": "9bbba0f31be22db3bd3dd946a230082f5d2591ce3a0d0a8b3fd1d9cac2bd891c",
      "text": "Now we understand about the messages array, let's apply it to a real-world (ish) example.",
      "hash": "220584ff367cf77c39979b13cef63cfa10b136957f450b4b575361a80fda47fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc092e0e7a2cac871c2a9ce9590e44348181dc42d8dc7e1860c2b9c7930d12ac",
      "text": "Go deeper:",
      "hash": "15ad3d88c6733d9b257c322d3afecc9bce2b18558171007db87598c118ca17f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "53798635978c981d5d0af004e1f96877f8fd4cff0b92a192421e613f59ea7313",
      "text": "join the waitlist for AI Coding for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "16c3492a8464a0859c944e287a9d433e9a2635f22a6bd8aad59f88c3e80ab732"
    },
    {
      "id": "c63912c6af048f42b689f34161446bec555da3832d3d99332ba76ea96c6b768b",
      "text": "For the first time here, we're going to set up a server.",
      "hash": "86f9e0cf1987c0b9c60f65d815cdcf9f9cf727f97a077e8b32e693e89bd46094"
    },
    {
      "id": "1478bcd9b3e434006abdebb3cef4502352adb8e6d2f332b82aaa2e15036cd17b",
      "text": "We're going to put it inside a",
      "hash": "e96a06f1f6190ce9fe3e26f7de119294bd9e3be084b8a0f2283d5d25b0d04651"
    },
    {
      "id": "91a1781658b0c27602669fdcc0cab89cca875ad1dae0398e564f3d07db999b97",
      "text": "function:",
      "hash": "671d7c1c412c57f3454b1f26c745f6f4d01fbe7cb5f68b76cc8b93c58a8f6aec"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9cc16ad1e3d214dda596ce442a07002310574f56fa866e4119244e5b8e3abd8",
      "text": "We'll use the Hono package to create a server:",
      "hash": "8e02db69339f05516ca259a207851f9011f8e24a29d4d2709c9107e8f9465a5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "576595442fc6858e75e7b9d46eb7dd95837f802d22aa58085ca9c31eaf11515e",
      "text": "We'll add a route to the server:",
      "hash": "c114273e81fb0b7b93d04f2703e48e0c04b11c4592413ff499aa08cb2c06ea65"
    },
    {
      "id": "fffd0e301b711fd60d46e07d40998afb9eed4f6a4e12bf3ab5a0d3368528944a",
      "text": "Then, we'll serve it with",
      "hash": "523c6126c8b47bedcac68eaad678430446dfd9b2ac9f498d9517ae81186f4670"
    },
    {
      "id": "4774e2248c234ece65c1510d973d7b5387c5f833d520707663437954c8d8d151",
      "text": "Finally, we'll wait for it to start using",
      "hash": "a1548f42057b96ef012fdb22deb65963adbadd8be4b880e50c521009c3831df4"
    },
    {
      "id": "64251708a0431ccd9fbbc6ea8a91e5dfa415fd2fcdfa260def580851a6d2545d",
      "text": "and return the",
      "hash": "230fa84849bbc45208113e1d64e7fe14229764bf899eb20d0b8daa28bb2fcc69"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f4ef9864e9ebb928476eb4dfa6e6738d1b169d72b71c8f4ee37489dc195bc4d",
      "text": "This gives us a nice function we can call to start a server on",
      "hash": "3ced85272bd2e86ee2058adb2e550de32067e35d112e4855ba32e76bc6f163a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4f7d4e96a1aa29f1be01907394c643efdd4d6c01a764e896ec95d022f4682ec",
      "text": "Next, let's build the API call:",
      "hash": "a02e32301f07c8d20342a9dc4cccd0148152f19952cc36e8fae2dac868128083"
    },
    {
      "id": "caa3311a8e0a908d89e2d124d9bb3856e18b803774ba103b56929274c4dd6971",
      "text": "Our",
      "hash": "1d20526a076c0916ebbd932f9e4d0fe47640ce063a02fa9228d1bd7d80ea8bc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e189ec7b17f83505d6b7f8970a865d4dc3dd6bfc8e7fe491f3b06d67c33d68a2",
      "text": "route is going to accept an array of",
      "hash": "367cc889d55ea1fc52c03e8dddccc53dd527a10816da13263d261c9fca7fd8fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "6dca6591a83dea07b98780a90641be70e60c75e65867c1b686b2b0e3a6f046e1",
      "text": "objects.",
      "hash": "9e92fb4d5be54fdeb80c142a6f22b9ed941700b3591452c79a204d6fb2de68ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "8b17743d2b34d32ce60d20d927271010740c9ed80fc255c4e9e2ece757d54715",
      "text": "We can then pass the entire conversation history into",
      "hash": "c074f9d7afd8c09c0ff5bd9056cd1cf2b630c13f60a808373368b46ee410a5a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "874e54a2c732f727e3e8af65333e11a0c734d56e518082368b32e7198622b2f8",
      "text": "Based on the conversation history, the LLM will figure out what it should try to say next.",
      "hash": "4d5bae941f244d5f57a31afa4800945fbed0bd55791bea8478ad84085c83c5ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07e4a65115811d90d3cf9aee885fc29baf3c8007e4aee319d4a1b9db0407afd",
      "text": "The messages that it suggests will be added to",
      "hash": "4ecc8e53bcba713aa181928e406bf118f43225a6329a975c4aa14b5b37a98f48"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d96767d1ba72ba1d650a8a0fb9d3dd86d66f7e798e35ac48f50496f8e2dda33",
      "text": "So we can return those as JSON using",
      "hash": "5c0b7836557b3cf1bc9b8300b8d6212b1e1728b2d952f8a0dfad509e89e84db5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7e38ab15bd93f8ae6057db8a3e0fe0d1e9963a1d8110bd142789afa184eda8c",
      "text": "To sum up, we've build an API endpoint that accepts a conversation history and returns the next message the LLM would say.",
      "hash": "7b512951960b4a3b0a6e3f45c816e954887b536057236d395c29f4b5e07d6f3f"
    },
    {
      "id": "4303a41f033d664c6ff0b7adbf42e940adc44cfa168c299099fe5777cdbb6278",
      "text": "This is a pretty common pattern. It means our server is entirely",
      "hash": "b68848b389b34c50d72b41acb349396737b16b5eb42b12d28db610420419d284"
    },
    {
      "id": "42fa684b9c95d265048b2ccc55ce94e96e671caee7ec9217ddeb72202a3584de",
      "text": "The responsibility for tracking the conversation lies with the client.",
      "hash": "3a5c1c87409ae56038e6f940421fd2f0b0b1cbcdf687a3aedccce4aab63fab48"
    },
    {
      "id": "baeb05a173b91c4c15f8904d827d72ab3799ce6830ac46f1691833ec436d613c",
      "text": "There are other ways of doing this, like storing the conversations on your server, but this is a simple way to get started.",
      "hash": "ced5056618be0376ca92c70746e8bdf2bc9c7ffbc16f19b90a87a261e9f39d43"
    },
    {
      "id": "cea0a3d0c383c9df4f8874dd18c55c48b5dabb0189947f2544f578278d79292f",
      "text": "Now we have a server, we can call it from the client. I'm running this on node, but you could easily run this in the browser too.",
      "hash": "dc23dcf35b473bbcf1104d3d5d173765a66db03a7ce3576f5879ea5a13ee47d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "cde6212811e06e7ee8a2ef42a04ff6e4e28d046ceff6ebedcf8bc81eaa445fff",
      "text": "Let's create a new array of messages, and start our server:",
      "hash": "6ceecb15396665c9748434bf880f646d66096709eb6d40b2a0e6566ee1da768c"
    },
    {
      "id": "e165261ee37f10745362150da632315f63ff39a253a90a9c689a8eb605b76856",
      "text": "We'll use",
      "hash": "99f8dfc8e3fc6970eb88298c4fdd33e3ec0c4f43880b89c1c48f7a380b585cd9"
    },
    {
      "id": "60d901b8b9ba2b19ab188ab42d7d1ca3fea27bb2a0a6e91670d0e60c0f997b98",
      "text": "to send the messages to the server, and",
      "hash": "81de29da06d5616c979cfeab30525693c7f60cd26ad0d61578bf78e0e6852d65"
    },
    {
      "id": "144936a21510dc8d5c9e9e1bfe149cc27da81ead37161ef600e5345ed361d133",
      "text": "to turn the response into JavaScript objects.",
      "hash": "671bf03ad008b1c3bbb8e1bd175d902aacac32f2014ff487591b58d95f3a2b0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae1e7886c8ad5047506b66b225284f72904a605bc8314605202a721e175bc49a",
      "text": "Finally, we'll append the new messages to the conversation history, and log it out.",
      "hash": "a39d1c412f6ca8d406e3ee2ac516c291c248e255b06d35c645f5163bc0120e7a"
    },
    {
      "id": "8485aeef4a40b5cf123c0ab3110a47cf29ac5181c6300a1f4fe22cba40066303",
      "text": "We end up with an output that looks like this:",
      "hash": "0eb6c77c02a4e4012a94340e4d11d09450d2156a667fe4e2b7ed44e4e4d44cce"
    },
    {
      "id": "13f1c96ed95cd3c7a63167d38f5e468eec8f6fea5f7dd91702f4c7db2fcab29d",
      "text": "This array is ready to receive another message with the role of",
      "hash": "d0fc41942236bd14feedb2d0f8f0de89af7b26641670e956f96909dde52a7703"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e46b5a7b0c8f8c05d568b84c87f58b3a73fa20475cd59b376fa28bb325ac0cf",
      "text": ", and the process can repeat.",
      "hash": "b36a38845a99a55ec31bac93d83964d033bba0255379c5d2e048c96cf630c629"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7790f40c6e08dbbe5aebd883b926222fc8afc276fa353cb58d519570ea4e9e4",
      "text": "In this example, we've shown how to keep track of a conversation history using the Vercel AI SDK.",
      "hash": "ad67da243bd3ce0aadd14469e970d384469fca26548ff5d21f6c3fd6c75f1f12"
    },
    {
      "id": "b59c52627c386939766957fecaafaedf8da85afb800151a7bb3c6d799ab7c26d",
      "text": "We've learned about the messages array, including the various roles.",
      "hash": "d8abfcf89dd81053ed2424fc0bfdc5637fb62c29f9828ba19c6976db59dcafeb"
    },
    {
      "id": "74525b05dacf6081c36ffdea42a75fe02feeade9a1b4e855144873055e60c4e0",
      "text": "We've seen how to set up a server that accepts a conversation history and appends to it.",
      "hash": "b967b8ba568af8283aa33a94015ba703781f9293f603b3196aec6e6cf91a7784"
    },
    {
      "id": "75403afa85fb4322e5b2da7633cf9ca36a560ff229cff5e74238cbf55c59cdc1",
      "text": "And we've seen how to call that server from a client.",
      "hash": "ef85e4ed9dc193a76a224fab091dcebf947d2d0426f5e455b92733f805463a46"
    },
    {
      "id": "604306d528919840ad92b9ea523130f243bb3ea55db8eaac5b18cf50b10eef21",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc2610c4ba6c09361f41e13fbe525ef4bdc6dd6709d50aa93fe1fef1fd326d6c",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "5142f169f2a05d88fa70f0a4826e38c18c7251afd07e36500656a1603f822094",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bfdd9fb7e18bf19b94d08fdcc8237426943f9c794b32410a10ef3f9220a6097",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa3a2038fc928eb58aaf1267384b5225c2b10e1991f347a1d200c2a222f1a945",
      "text": "Previous",
      "hash": "a57b08a480b822a0a572b993391c292ede593bf8000b406675b180bbb16260fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b242e5244537f67bf15a3c0a6a54339ced256a7ba5ae9fd6beeda8e2364a103",
      "text": "Up next · lesson",
      "hash": "7915dcb8d2117c7a6a8fa6d5a1901ad5fa87b609352be8aca042d9a52d097c78"
    },
    {
      "id": "342c248748d2172bb5ca98ca6d678f06d3785789cf80f43d86ce316c3f4a6ec5",
      "text": "Log in",
      "hash": "c189840cf7e2d6f6fdeefde1ac59dfdf50bb75642eb569b4e38a5614d6f12ac2"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b64f4fa22e99ba22bff774358581e1742f49a6666caf2572b13fd5b32c9da6d",
      "text": "to save progress.",
      "hash": "80e970a1e5533be8e269820a64ae4280cb79d1ea60f31e0a89863e1ddd0aee48"
    },
    {
      "id": "0388daaf9bf13cf702ffca2633316744579bf609971c92b61966158a47aa221e",
      "text": "Learn",
      "hash": "ce78afd0e6a225ecac96a6812b9d192e7eb35889cd5237beb38b50375b79d8dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "696d5a93ad2447f4026ee126b4a6014bf931e31d768f957bed5404d884bc9b10",
      "text": "AI SDK v6 Crash Course",
      "hash": "71139c58dab0fc6fcc2f49d2d44fd5b7c9e9e6e7fbf043ec2f4b51758b1b82b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bd09a663d399d25465f96d5302a02c1a35660e32223a3403752addc078e5aa28",
      "text": "The AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "0ecca41f97662f50fc4210f00b4d05ed73257d862ecbd642b906cd7da42d4092"
    },
    {
